<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.7.1">
<l>taṅkaiyai mūkkun tamaiyaṉait talaiyun taṭintaven tācara tipō</l>
<l>yeṅkuntaṉ pukaḻā viruntara cāṇṭa vempuru ṭō ttama ṉirukkai</l>
<l>kaṅkaikaṅ kaiyeṉ ṟavācakat tālē kaṭuviṉai kaḷaintiṭa kiṟkuṅ</l>
<l>kaṅkaiyiṉ karaimēl kaitoḻa niṉṟa kaṇṭameṉ ṉuṅkaṭi nakarē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The residence of our Puruṣottama</l>
<l rend="indent">who rules [his] kingdom being praised everywhere,</l>
<l>[who] came to us as Dāśarathi who cut off the nose of the younger sister</l>
<l rend="indent">and the head of the older bother,</l>
<l>is the protected city called Kaṇṭam,</l>
<l rend="indent">where [he] stands to be worshipped with joined hands</l>
<l>on the banks of the Ganges,</l>
<l rend="indent">exterminating painful karma with the words, “Ganges Ganges”.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
